            "review_title": "Review at Summer Experiment",
            "review_text": "The.rated.and.reviewed\nCastle Rock, Colorado324 contributions\n0\nSummer experiment is an institution :)\nJul 2026 • Couples\nThe summer experiment is a force multiplier, and we've been here numerous times and every single time we walk through the door. It is a different experience.... It's awesome and it gets better and better every time we show up.. The happy hour is out of bounds drinks that are on point perfectly balanced and things that you would never consider working work, the service, the staff, the appointments all amazing. Amazing! This is an institution of Saigon and a place you have to check out...\nA open bar with bartenders that know what they're doing. Pouring generously and making delicious drinks and a little bites menu that could substitute for a dinner. Everything has a good balance here and the personalities make it well worth climbing up the three flights of stairs.\nThe bartenders and staff are entertaining, are smart and intelligent and have a good time with the guests. This is a fantastic bar to come spend a bit of time\nRead more\nWritten July 11, 2026",
