            "review_text": "YY_Xie\nSingapore, Singapore651 contributions\n0\nTry Bees on Your Knees & Diggin' That Soursop\nSep 2025 • Friends\nMy friend & I tried 5 cocktails: (1) Pomelo's Senorita, (2) Bee on Your Knees, (3) Diggin' That Soursop, (4) On Cloud 9 and (5) Bounty Hunter. (1) was not exactly noteworthy. (2) with its chamomile flavour and polaroid photo moment was a winner. (3) tasted more of black tea than soursop, but despite its unassuming presentation (we mistook it for a glass of ice water), was lovely. (4) was literally over the top with its foam, but was less impressive in terms of taste - it was mostly lavender and no earl grey. (5) was the most expensive, but its ingredient description turned out to be more sophisticated than it actually was. We also had the prawn fritters, which was tasty and fresh. Loved the vibes overall and staff were friendly, but the cocktails were a bit of a hit and miss. Nevertheless, the strokes of genius shine through, and I would visit again the next time I'm in the city.\nRead more\nWritten September 8, 2025",
